Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:01:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Mayushii!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is today the last day of ComiMa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,want to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll have lots of cute cosplay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not really interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Okarin's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He said we weren't doing the cracking, and that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They said it's gonna reach a high of 35!{35°C = 95°F}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying hydrated is the best way to prevent heatstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to ComiMa today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.45,0:02:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really sunny out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}August 17th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Each D-Mail I undid delayed Mayuri's death by one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Erasing Suzuha's D-Mail made the events of the 13th occur on the 14th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Faris, Lukako, Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If each one pushed it back a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then in this worldline, Mayuri will die on the 17th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today, before 8:00 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was almost sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I got one for Daru too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there was a book on a robot anime I thought you'd like!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me if there's anywhere you'd like to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to think about, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Organization assassins hiding in this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to do something to escape their clutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not careful, they might find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the original plan until evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think any bad people like that are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going scouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet back here at 1500.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're selling juice over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Five hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before then, I'll have to find...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a way for her to survive without changing worldlines.
