Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.61,0:04:52.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(913.5,538.5)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:52.69,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(913.5,538.5)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:52.73,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(912,549)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:52.77,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(912,549)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:52.81,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(912,549)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:52.86,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\pos(906,531)\frx6\fry2\frz355.18}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:52.90,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\pos(906,531)\frx6\fry2\frz355.18}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:52.94,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\pos(906,531)\frx6\fry2\frz355.18}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:52.98,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(909,534)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:53.02,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(909,534)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:53.06,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(909,534)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:53.11,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(913.5,541.5)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:54.32,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs64.5\be5\frx6\fry2\frz355.18\pos(913.5,541.5)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:05:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to help Hashida?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A notepad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A list of circles at ComiMa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The rack?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The second shelf?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at the second shelf?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seriously having you arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with the cracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You stopped it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,so we haven't touched it for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain what's going on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri will die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you're doing the cracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To erase the first D-Mail you sent—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to think of a way to save Mayuri without the cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have changed. This is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't explain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Some other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I won't be able to think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have time for this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hide things now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, want to stop by the lab, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii was thinking of getting some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's almost time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}almost time for her to die again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I run?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, that never works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come with me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You barely went to see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanted to check something out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've shown you around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't many things Mayushii knows more than Okarin about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never gone to ComiMa together,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so Mayushii was happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see Lukako looking embarrassed in cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame he didn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if he had, he would've been really popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Luka would've gotten his photo on all the blogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and he would've become a worldwide superstar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Mayushii would've seen it and said, "He's come a long way."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really see that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be even better if Okarin cosplayed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But in exchange, you'd have to do it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll call Lukako and Christina,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and you can convince them to do it with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can do that, then I,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin Kyouma the mad scientist,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,shall make my cosplay debut at ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's going to be hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kurisu was interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so Mayushii will try her best to do it by the next ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The next...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wound—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This can't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to change fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll stop it from happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I let that car hit me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I die here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}something has to change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally... Finally, I was useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii was useful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see the stars from here, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.25,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.2\move(1599,784.5,1372.5,784.5,0,2460)\frz339.8}I want to talk to you. \NKurisu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start the cracking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to lie there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:27.21,op trans,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You did,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've been on the roof for hours
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,without so much as a peep, so I got worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not worried, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop the cracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought the FBI would come, and you got scared, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to be thought of as a law-abiding citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your normal hotshot attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The great mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I act like that right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew within five seconds of meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you time leap again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've helped you with everything so far, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it this far by thinking things through together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This far, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha and Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,To come this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed the things they wanted the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, this is how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, you were crying back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida was worried too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He thought maybe you had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,July 28th...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri and I went to Doctor Nakabachi's press conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I saw Makise Kurisu collapsed after being stabbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know by whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent a text to Daru's cell phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,which was connected to the PhoneWave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The first D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the message that moved us
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,from the Beta worldline to the Alpha worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:14:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Deleting that message from SERN's database
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and returning to the Beta worldline
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,means going back to that world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If we return to the Beta worldline...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If we undo that first D-Mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Daru told me you were acting odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's been so busy with ComiMa
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,that she couldn't spend time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you used to talk to Mayushii about all kinds of stuff, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There were four Organization generals,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Geppu, Sudachi, Seiyuu, and Jakkou?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Genbu, Suzaku, Seiryuu, and Byakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I really liked hearing about those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mayushii is ever a burden, you'd tell me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you alone for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mayushii can do anything for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,call me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,From your voice, I can guess what she was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go see her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to come up with any answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you stay here to talk to with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you were sitting here alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:15:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you should go see Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:16:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only hurt my pride if you stay here and worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mayushii. I can't answer the phone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the cosplayers said Mayushii left a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to see me because it's Obon, right, Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only been having scary dreams lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In the dreams, terrible things happen to Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets shot with a pistol,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,or she's in a car accident or run over by a train,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and everything seems like it really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary, and it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to scream for help as loud as I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have these dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the end of the dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin always comes to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii says, "Thank you, Okarin!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He holds Mayushii, and he looks sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He never cries, but you can tell he really wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mayushii says,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but he doesn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk about something fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, there have been a lot of new lab mems!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Kurisu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka, and Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, it was just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu is super smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and she talks about all these really hard things with Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.97,0:18:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin looks happy now that he gets to talk so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you know, sometimes I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the first time Mayushii went to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.15,0:18:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the beginning of spring, but it was snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When I went to the lab after school,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,While I was cleaning up the room, he came in,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and I said, "Welcome back!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't say, "I'm back."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, "Good work."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, every day after that, I'd go there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,for about two hours, and we would barely talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't bad. We were simply there together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.93,0:19:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Time passed so slowly, and it was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii thought she really was like a hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing good happened, but it was good anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You saw some kind of illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may be an attack by Organization General Illusion Conductor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I'll have to be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I bet that Illusion Contactor—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Conductor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:20:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't think he's a bad person!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't spent much time talking with Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be that, when I saw him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell what he was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But recently, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell he's really suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.87,0:20:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,like he's always about to cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know he's thinking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a burden to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking about something sad again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Mayushii's been lonely lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay this way forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I always know where my hostage is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can't get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,am not so weak that I need you to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to get another Upa toy, right?
